WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.850
[Soft keys and wooden percussion]
A yellow squirrel holds an acorn beside a tiny bee.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.750
A maker types “Build a sales workspace for my small design studio.”

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.850
The maker chooses Nova CRM from the working templates.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:24.750
In the visual studio, the maker selects the heading,
renames it “Acorn Studio” and changes its color.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:31.850
The same dashboard appears on desktop and phone.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.250
Ideas, Assistant, Templates, Studio, Connections, Publish.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.480
The squirrel flicks its g-shaped tail. What will you make?
